<title>UK: Ushers win contract to brew Amstel beer.</title>
<headline>Ushers win contract to brew Amstel beer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regional brewer Ushers of Trowbridge Group Plc said on Thursday it has won a contract from HP Bulmer Holdings Plc to brew and pack Dutch beer, Amstel.</p>
<p>The contract was awarded after Bulmers won a 10 year distribution contract from Heineken NV, the owners of Amstel.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
